# Endrider Catalyzer (3/1, Start your engines!): "Max speed — {T}: Add {R}{R}" (CR 702.178a, 605.1a). Bot1 casts it and a Savannah Lions on
# turn 1 (speed 1); the Lions attacks into an empty board on turns 3, 5, 7 (speed 2, 3, 4; CR 702.179d) while the Catalyzer stays home.
# On turn 7, at speed 3 (one short of max), tapping it for mana is refused; after the Lions' hit makes speed 4 it taps for exactly {R}{R}
# (the pool holds both), which pays for a Lightning Bolt on Bot2: 20 - 3 x 2 - 3 = 11.

